{"ordinal":14126,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452572651526","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Death_02fa5cb","source":"Couple: Тихо, тихо.","target":"Couple: Ușor, ușor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
