{"ordinal":14129,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452572651523","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_DontShoot_0f01ea8","source":"Couple: А мы только-то и хотим, что спокойно добраться до дома. Без приключений.","target":"Couple: Noi vrem doar să ajungem acasă liniștiți. Fără peripeții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14130,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452572651522","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_DontShoot_03b70f4","source":"Couple: Меньше знаешь – крепче спишь. Хорошая поговорка.","target":"Couple: Cu cât știi mai puține, cu atât dormi mai bine. O vorbă bună.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14131,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452572651521","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_DontShoot_0e8320d","source":"Couple: Жизнь научила лишний раз не говорить, кто мы и где.","target":"Couple: Viața m-a învățat să nu spun fără rost cine suntem și unde ne aflăm.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14132,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452572651520","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_DontShoot_0b62521","source":"Couple: Это же справедливо? Требовать от человека чистоплотности – не тирания же, верно?","target":"Couple: E drept, nu? Să ceri cuiva să fie curat nu înseamnă tiranie, nu-i așa?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14133,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452568457227","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_DontShoot_0a724a3","source":"Couple: Она даёт то, что я прошу.","target":"Couple: Ea îmi dă ce-i cer.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14134,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452568457226","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_DontShoot_094fc89","source":"Couple: У каждого свои дела. Я даю ей безопасность и несу к родителям.","target":"Couple: Fiecare cu treaba lui. Eu îi ofer siguranță și o duc la părinți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14135,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452568457225","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_DontShoot_00be511","source":"Couple: Что ты вздрогнула? Не бойся, мы вместе.","target":"Couple: De ce ai tresărit? Nu-ți fie frică, suntem împreună.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14136,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452568457224","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_DontShoot_0de3d07","source":"Couple: Пока я могу только тренироваться.","target":"Couple: Deocamdată nu pot decât să mă antrenez.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-360.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
