{"ordinal":14186,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680008","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_034d891","source":"Couple: Ладно, фотографируйте. Но вы отдадите фото, да?","target":"Couple: Bine, fotografiați-mă. Dar o să-mi dați fotografia, da?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14187,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680007","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_016db2b","source":"Couple: …","target":"Couple: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14188,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680006","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_036f144","source":"Couple: Дайте подумать.","target":"Couple: Lăsați-mă să mă gândesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14189,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680005","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_026b1b7","source":"Couple: Но… так у вас будут основания нас подозревать…","target":"Couple: Dar… așa ați avea motive să ne bănuiți…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14190,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680004","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_089ccc9","source":"Couple: Меня фотографировать не надо. Жену тоже.","target":"Couple: Pe mine nu trebuie să mă fotografiați. Nici pe soția mea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14191,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680003","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Photo_0ed0e01","source":"Couple: Неужели это одна из проверок?","target":"Couple: Chiar e una dintre verificări?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14192,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680002","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_0f5d830","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14193,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680001","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_028aa79","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14194,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452551680000","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_0e85e8f","source":"Couple: Моё дело – не дать ей умереть среди озлобленной толпы чудовищ.","target":"Couple: Treaba mea e să n-o las să moară în mijlocul unei gloate furioase de monștri.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14195,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485707","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_0b5d25d","source":"Couple: Женщины должны брить волосы на теле. А мне-то зачем?","target":"Couple: Femeile trebuie să-și radă părul de pe corp. Dar eu de ce aș face-o?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14196,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485706","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_0eb6be7","source":"Couple: Тоже так думаешь?","target":"Couple: Și tu crezi la fel?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14197,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485705","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_01fbe26","source":"Couple: В такую погоду хотя бы это поможет немного с терморегуляцией.","target":"Couple: Pe vremea asta, măcar atât ajută puțin la reglarea temperaturii corpului.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14198,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485704","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_05a0bda","source":"Couple: Женщины должны брить волосы на теле. Почему я не должен?","target":"Couple: Femeile trebuie să-și radă părul de pe corp. Eu de ce n-aș face-o?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14199,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485703","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_0410460","source":"Couple: ...","target":"Couple: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14200,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485702","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Armpit_03f4403","source":"Couple: Ну нет, это точно только я покажу.","target":"Couple: Nu, asta sigur vă arăt doar eu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14201,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485701","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_0fff01c","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14202,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485700","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_0077214","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14203,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485699","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_0e0c951","source":"Couple: Может ли быть иначе, когда на тебе ответственность за двоих сразу?","target":"Couple: Cum altfel să fie când răspund de amândoi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14204,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485698","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_0a54cf9","source":"Couple: Ладно, я сильно волнуюсь.","target":"Couple: Bine, sunt foarte neliniștit.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14205,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485697","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_0bcc40a","source":"Couple: ...","target":"Couple: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14206,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452547485696","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_0b97b2b","source":"Couple: Я, конечно, немного волнуюсь, но, согласитесь, все эти проверки пугают, даже если у тебя нет признаков Гостя.","target":"Couple: Sigur, sunt puțin neliniștit, dar recunoașteți că toate verificările astea sperie, chiar dacă n-ai niciun semn de Musafir.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14207,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291402","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Eyes_0d65c54","source":"Couple: Да, давай я свои покажу.","target":"Couple: Da, hai să vi le arăt pe ale mele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14208,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291401","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_0088725","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14209,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291400","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_02d16ce","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14210,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291399","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_04dc58d","source":"Couple: Может, поэтому Гости такие? Они не болеют?","target":"Couple: Poate de-asta sunt Musafirii așa? Ei nu se îmbolnăvesc?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14211,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291398","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_0f823a6","source":"Couple: Может, поэтому Гости сильнее? Они не болеют?","target":"Couple: Poate de-asta sunt Musafirii mai puternici? Ei nu se îmbolnăvesc?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14212,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291397","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_0e1ef40","source":"Couple: Некому будет помочь, если я заболею, например.","target":"Couple: N-o să aibă cine să ne ajute dacă, de pildă, mă îmbolnăvesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14213,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291396","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_059a304","source":"Couple: Мне кажется, даже в наших условиях странно не следить за внешностью.","target":"Couple: Mi se pare ciudat să nu-ți îngrijești înfățișarea, chiar și în condițiile de acum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14214,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291395","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_061efcf","source":"Couple: ...","target":"Couple: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14215,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291394","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Hands_0b31ec5","source":"Couple: Да, мы с женой чистоплотны. Так что проблем не будет.","target":"Couple: Da, și eu, și soția mea avem grijă să fim curați. Așa că n-o să fie nicio problemă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14216,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291393","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_0cc74d8","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14217,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452543291392","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_0ea6f85","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14218,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452539097100","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_08cb02a","source":"Couple: Наверняка подыхают где-нибудь в переулке от рук таких же уродов, как и они сами.","target":"Couple: Probabil zac pe moarte pe vreo alee, uciși de niște nenorociți la fel ca ei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14219,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452539097099","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_0b56a3b","source":"Couple: Но где обидчики теперь?","target":"Couple: Dar unde sunt acum cei care mă chinuiau?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14220,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452539097098","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_0432d4c","source":"Couple: Зубы не очень ровные, но какие есть. Из-за них надо мной смеялись в школе.","target":"Couple: Dinții nu-mi sunt prea drepți, dar ăștia sunt. Din cauza lor râdeau de mine la școală.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14221,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452539097097","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_001033c","source":"Couple: Вы и сами понимаете, насколько всё в жизни непросто.","target":"Couple: Și dumneavoastră știți cât de complicată e viața.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14222,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452539097096","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_0a1a0ce","source":"Couple: ...","target":"Couple: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14223,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452539097095","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Couple_Teeth_0cd96bc","source":"Couple: Чтобы защищать близких, иногда приходится вгрызаться в жизнь зубами, ахаха.","target":"Couple: Ca să-i aperi pe cei dragi, uneori trebuie să te agăți cu dinții de viață, ahaha.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-361.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
